9?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/swinslow","html_url":"https://github.com/swinslow","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/swinslow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/swinslow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/swinslow/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/swinslow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/swinslow/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/swinslow/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/swinslow/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/swinslow/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/swinslow/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2021-11-15T14:26:00Z","updated_at":"2021-11-15T14:26:00Z","body":"I meant to mention also -- I do think it should be added as a separate identifier, rather than expanding [`HaskellReport`](https://spdx.org/licenses/HaskellReport.html) to include it.\r\n\r\nThe `HaskellReport` license includes a requirement that the report be \"reproduced in its entirety\", whereas this `SchemeReport` license permits copying \"in whole or in part\". So even though they might have had a common origin, I think they're substantially different in effect and should get separate identifiers.","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/comments/968962356/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/comments/969085112","html_url":"https://github.com/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/1340#issuecomment-969085112","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/1340","id":969085112,"node_id":"IC_kwDOA0JFE845wxC4","user":{"lo